{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24064","headline":"老热 · 白居易","name":"老热","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一饱百情足，一酣万事休。\n何人不衰老，我老心无忧。\n仕者拘职役，农者劳田畴。\n何人不苦热，我热身自由。\n卧风北窗下，坐月南池头。\n脑凉脱乌帽，足热濯清流。\n慵发昼高枕，兴来夜泛舟。\n何乃有余适，祗缘无过求。\n或问诸亲友，乐天是与不。\n亦无别言语，多道天悠悠。\n悠悠君不知，此味深且幽。\n但恐君知後，亦来从我游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}